@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Ready
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Saurav Sarkar",
  "email": "saurav@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123!"
}

### Verify email (copy token from development mail log)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_LOG"
}

### Login admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### Me
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin users: pagination + search + filter + sort
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users?page=1&limit=20&search=&role=&isVerified=true&isActive=true&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh (uses refresh_token cookie if your HTTP client stores cookies)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
